1. SGP4

Sources/GPKit/SGP4Core.swift is a port to Swift of the propagation routines of David Vallado's SGP4.cpp (sgp4init,
sgp4, initl, dscom, dpper, dsinit, dspace, getgravconst and gstime_SGP4), and Tests/SGP4Oracle/vallado/ holds that
file and its header unmodified, compiled by the tests alone, for the port to be compared with:

    CelesTrak/fundamentals-of-astrodynamics, software/cpp/SGP4/SGP4/SGP4.cpp and SGP4.h
    https://github.com/CelesTrak/fundamentals-of-astrodynamics
    commit 49df0479c950 ("SGP4 Version 2025-12-30")
    SHA-256  SGP4.cpp  7e984e29a66f75a2b5ad3881f0e5dc0f8fbf9ee8de675ee39be1c9092bc3f183
             SGP4.h    0563e6e8027607452e451d2342da96e5b376a1c119675c40940866f2e04c0bd6

That repository is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0, with one exception, stated in its
NOTICE file, which reads in full at that commit:

